# =============================================================================
# Work directory - ALL generated artifacts go here
# =============================================================================
# The work directory contains all target-codebase-specific data:
# - Indexed summaries, hashes, module maps
# - Ticket data, lessons learned
# - Log files, cost tracking
# Set WORK_DIR env var to customize location (default: ./work/)
work/

